# Context Artifact Advisor

Use this skill only when the human explicitly asks for context artifact advice.

## Scope

Manual mode only.

Analyze:

- visible conversation context;
- root agent instructions;
- `docs/ai/advisor/` proposal files;
- directly relevant project workflow docs.

Do not:

- enable hooks;
- capture session ledgers;
- read the whole repository without a bounded reason;
- implement proposed artifacts;
- expose secrets or raw sensitive content.

## Look For

- repeated human corrections;
- recurring command, verification, or planning friction;
- token-heavy repeated discovery;
- rules that exist only in chat;
- workflows that should become skills;
- deterministic checks that should become scripts;
- future hooks or adapters that need explicit approval.

## Proposal Threshold

Create a proposal only when:

- the issue repeated at least twice;
- or severity is high, such as secret risk, destructive action risk, CI blocker, or production risk;
- or the human explicitly said to remember, automate, or always do something.

## Output

Use `docs/ai/advisor/proposal-schema.md`.

Update `docs/ai/advisor/proposals/index.md` if creating a proposal file.

Stop after proposals and ask for review.

